### Register Owner
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@test.com",
  "password": "Secret123",
  "displayName": "Game Shop",
  "role": "owner"
}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@test.com",
  "password": "Secret123"
}

### Refresh Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}
